Hits the target doing [72%, 81%, 88%, 94%, 100% (TL1-5)] damage. If the attack hits, the target is afflicted with a disease, inflicting [35, 37, 39, 41, 43 (TL1-5; STR 100)] blight damage per turn for [13, 17, 20, 22, 25 (TL1-5)] turns and reducing strength by 10% + 4.  The disease damage increases with your Strength, and the chance to apply it increases with your Physical Power.
